# ---- Package manager specifics (uncomment what applies) ----
# npm
# package-lock.json is COMMITTED (reproducible builds)
# yarn
# yarn.lock is COMMITTED
# pnpm
# pnpm-lock.yaml is COMMITTED
# Python (uv)
# uv.lock is COMMITTED
# Go
# go.sum is COMMITTED
# Rust
# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED